<title>UK: Kredietbank unit adds 15 mln Ecu to 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit adds 15 mln Ecu to 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, originally launched on December 3, 1996, has been increased to 70 million Ecu from 55 million Ecu, lead manager Kredietbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK  (SUBORDINATED)</p>
<p> AMT    70 MLN ECU    COUPON   * 4.00	MATURITY    20.JAN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    * FIRST TWO YEARS, 5.0 PCT TO YEAR FOUR, 6.75 PCT TO</p>
<p>		YEAR SIX, 9.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
